      "range": [21.32, 24.42], "ans": [11]},
    {"lyric": "Honja seoseo geujeo meonghani",
      "lyric_hangul": "혼자 서서 그저 멍하니",
      "lyric_translation": "Just blanking standing there",
      "range": [24.42, 27.28], "ans": [11]},
    {"lyric": "Nugungal sseulsseulhi aetage",
