      "lyric_translation": "Felt like I was looking at me",
      "range": [30.69, 32.6], "ans": [11]},
    "",
    {
      "lyric_hangul": "이런저런 일들 숨가쁘게 바쁜",
      "lyric_translation": "Many things happen / So busy without a breath to catch",
      "parts": [
