      "lyric_translation": "Because of this damn world",
      "range": [35.48, 37.27], "ans": [8]},
    {"lyric": "Geora dulleodaemyeon",
      "lyric_hangul": "너와 내가 멀어진 거라 둘러대면",
      "lyric_translation": "If I say that’s why we grew apart",
      "range": [37.27, 43.06], "ans": [8]},
